    "text": "Agents today read and write plain text only (`read_file`, `write_file`, 256 KB caps, `crates/delphi-engine/src/tools.rs`). This spec gives them the common document formats, in two phases: **read first, create second**, with charting and data visualization as a first-class part of creation."
